  "description": "Lightly based on Heli's makeup corner in the old house (video sources/old house/20261028_235945.mp4, ~18-19 s): an L-shaped white corner desk - one wing along the back wall (thin legs at its end, her lamp + round mirror) and one along the side wall with a 5-drawer tower under it facing the room and a white tri-fold mirror on it. Added for Mark: a strong LED vanity light bar on the side wall over the mirror, its cord in a white cover down to an outlet under the desk, so she doesn't need the room light. Origin back-centre of the back wing; the side wing runs along the item's -x side (put the item in a corner with offset 0). Back wing 88 x 42, side wing 40 deep x 82 long, 75 high - estimated, not measured.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "parts",
    "notes": "Look from the old-house video frames at ~18-19 s; sizes estimated from the floor tiles, not measured. Light bar = a typical 60 cm LED vanity/mirror light (~10 W, ~900 lm).",
    "license": "self-made"
  },
